- look_here: `focusRect` on the text box, others dimmed to 0.7, the target and its icon not dimmed;
- `texts()` fields;
- remedies: size cap, `safe`, scrim for `item`, `row` and `heading`;
- a picture panel;
- no `''` writes in `update`;
- the fit on a fake text layout: 16:9 shrink to 44 px; overflow at the floor; an unavoidable long word costs no size; a word that would break at 64 px holds the size at 60 px; 9:16 stack tops and sizes; overflow past the bottom; the all-compact fallback.

