findings.suggested_fix:
Never drop rows. Options:
- shrink the formula toward 68 px and the title to one line first;
- set the legend as compact 40-44 px label rows, or in two columns of symbol and meaning;
- or report overflow so preflight shrinks or blocks ("Shorten text").
If a stack is kept, earlier rows must stay as compact rows (L-13), never fade out.
